6. NEOMSC detection signature
======================================================================

Origin:  NEOMSC, part of "MUSIC ARENA 2026" by MEGAFEPPS
In tree: src/vessel.c

A 30-byte sequence from NEOMSC, used only as a fingerprint to detect that
NEOMSC was loaded. It is compared against, never executed, and is not a
code contribution. Its origin and purpose are commented at the site.


